Zak lives on a <i>boring</i> desert farm. He’s seen one sand dune, and frankly, he’s had enough. Enter Ramius, an ancient warrior who casually mentions that Zak’s whole life is about to get a little <i>more interesting</i>. Turns out, there’s an ancient alien race called <i>The Ancient</i>, who built the Ancient Orbs. These orbs were supposed to unite the planets, but now they’re <i>all gone</i> like a bad sequel to a classic movie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zak’s family had one of these Orbs, and just when Zak thought life couldn’t get worse, it’s <i>stolen</i> by a bunch of weird, faceless soldiers. Zak grabs Ramius' ancient energy weapon, and with nothing but a sword, a dream, and a serious case of teenage angst, he sets off on a galaxy-spanning journey to retrieve these mystical spheres and <i>maybe</i> fix the galaxy along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along his adventures, Zak finds blueprints for more Ancient technology, making his weapon <i>unbelievably</i> powerful. Only with these upgrades will Zak survive the increasingly absurd challenges ahead. And what’s his end goal? To find and defeat the evil villainous forces who stole the Orbs in the first place – because, naturally, there has to be a villain. It's the <i>law</i> of the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/b6a61638df6b3c1dcd35fe0d7c252740.avif?t=1786378270\" width=780 height=402 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summary in a Nutshell</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zak’s just trying to make it as a farm boy. Then bam! Ancient Orbs, lasers, explosions, and lots of very bad guys. Now he’s the galaxy’s last hope. Not bad for a guy who used to milk space cows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to wield your <i>Laser Katana</i>, <i>solve the universe’s problems</i>, and try not to blow up too many things (although, let’s be honest, you probably will).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/extras/31e3f4be232ae1403883f1f46fa41256.avif?t=1786378270\" width=600 height=143 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Zak’s gotta save the galaxy! Travel across 5 planets, upgrade your Laser Katana, battle evil, and dive into a wild sci-fi B-movie action-adventure!", "supported_languages": "English, German", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/da5c35b1869b66ddf2f0027771b7ecea7ae49b94/header.jpg?t=1786378270", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/181c58c22ca1418169b3bd8663705efaf96759ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786378270", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512850/181c58c22ca1418169b3bd8663705efaf96759ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786378270", "website": "https://heathaze.games", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8, 10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 Quad-Core, 2.7 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 660 / RX 460<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Gamepad or Controller Recommended.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8, 10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 Quad-Core, 3 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</stro